<script setup lang="ts">import {computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {runs} from '../stores/runs';import {analysisMethodLabels} from '../constants/enums';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import AgreementPlot from '../components/AgreementPlot.vue';import CalibrationMetrics from '../components/CalibrationMetrics.vue';onMounted(runs.load);const result=computed(()=>(runs.items.value.find(r=>r.id==='demo-run')||runs.items.value.find(r=>r.status==='completed'))?.result);const isLog=computed(()=>!!result.value?.log_agreement);</script><template><PageHeading index="00 / 校准总览" title="一条校准线，还需要一张一致性图。" note="两侧探头均有误差。用Deming回归校准关系，再用Bland–Altman检视偏倚、量级趋势及界限外配对；高读数段波动随量级增大时切换对数比值口径。"/><template v-if="result"><p class="method-banner">分析方式：<b>{{analysisMethodLabels[result.analysis_method||'difference']}}</b> · 单位 {{result.unit}}</p><CalibrationMetrics :result="result"/><div class="overview-layout"><section><div class="section-heading"><h2>双探头关系 · {{result.unit}}</h2><a href="#/results">查看完整运行底稿 ↗</a></div><AgreementPlot :result="result" mode="deming"/><div class="method-ribbon"><b>{{result.n}} 组</b><span>{{result.x_serial}} ↔ {{result.y_serial}}</span><span>三量程 / 同单位配对</span></div></section><aside class="field-note"><p class="eyebrow">AGREEMENT CHECK</p><h2>{{isLog?'对数比值，是否随量级变化？':'差值，是否随量级变化？'}}</h2><AgreementPlot :result="result" :mode="isLog?'log_ba':'ba'"/><p>一致性界限是分布的近似覆盖范围，不是偏倚的置信区间。界限内也不直接表示设备可互换。{{isLog?'对数口径界限为比值倍数，容差按相对偏差百分比解释。':''}}</p></aside></div><section class="workflow-strip"><div><b>01 / 配对</b><h3>同一对象，同一单位</h3><p>拒绝重复ID、缺失与非有限值；对数口径另要求全部读数严格为正。</p></div><div><b>02 / 估计</b><h3>先写明误差比</h3><p>λ=var(y误差)/var(x误差)，不自动猜测；Deming始终用原读数。</p></div><div><b>03 / 复核</b><h3>让结论保留边界</h3><p>对照量程、异常配对与现场校准标准。</p></div></section></template></template>
